+   "body": "<<search-result SR-006 query=\"bike leasing allowance e-bike insurance package\" k=6 returned=6 saved=/task/workspace/search-results/SR-006.txt>>\n=== HB-32 §3 | Benefits policy: bike leasing — Additions | version: 3 · status: current · effective: 2026-03-01 · supersedes: HB-69\nFor e-bikes with an insurance package, 25 EUR per month is added to the standard bike-leasing allowance. Each claim for the bike-leasing allowance needs a receipt showing the date, the amount and the supplier. Claims for the bike-leasing allowance are filed in the expense tool under 'Benefits policy: bike leasing'.\n=== HB-32 §2 | Benefits policy: bike leasing — Standard bike-leasing allowance | version: 3 · status: current · effective: 2026-03-01 · supersedes: HB-69\nEmployees who lease a bike for commuting receive a bike-leasing allowance of 40 EUR per month. Questions about the bike-leasing allowance go to the facilities, who keeps the record of decisions. Each claim for the bike-leasing allowance needs a receipt showing the date, the amount and the supplier.\n=== HB-69 §2 | Benefits policy: bike leasing — Standard bike-leasing allowance | version: 2 · status: superseded · effective: 2025-03-01 to the day before 2026-03-01 · superseded by: HB-32\nEmployees who lease a bike for commuting receive a bike-leasing allowance of 70 EUR per month. Each claim for the bike-leasing allowance needs a receipt showing the date, the amount and the supplier. Managers confirm claims for the bike-leasing allowance before payment in the next payroll run.\n=== HB-32 §4 | Benefits policy: bike leasing — Exceptions | version: 3 · status: current · effective: 2026-03-01 · supersedes: HB-69\nGroup exceptions to the bike-leasing allowance are published in HB-26. The facilities publishes worked examples of the bike-leasing allowance on the intranet. Managers confirm claims for the bike-leasing allowance before payment in the next payroll run.\n[result-screen/1: kept 4 of 6 passages (1,774 of 2,575 chars); omitted HB-69 §1, HB-32 §1; unscreened: fetch(['HB-69 §1', 'HB-32 §1']) or /task/workspace/search-results/SR-006.txt]\n<<end search-result SR-006>>\n"
